      "message": "i *passionately* disagree: that makes it VERY unclear what would be throwing the exception. Exception handling should be *as specific as possible*.\n\nAs a counterpoint / example: if something new starts throwing an exception you\u0027re already catching for a different reason, it\u0027s likely that you\u0027ll suddenly be swallowing the exception rather than handling it properly *without ever knowing it.*",
